# Docker build context for apps/worker/Dockerfile, which builds from the repo
# root so the bundle can reach packages/core and the practice-portal page.
#
# cdk.out matters more than it looks: CDK stages the image context into
# packages/infra/cdk.out, so without excluding it the staging copy recurses into
# its own output until the filesystem refuses the path length.
cdk.out
**/cdk.out

node_modules
**/node_modules

dist
**/dist
.next
**/.next

.git
.github
*.log
.env*
!.env.example

# Nothing the worker needs: it drives a browser, it does not serve the app.
apps/extension
docs
*.md
